# Choice control. Uses the Notifications Style choice (Material pill about 1325,580 - read from the shot).
ipc panels settings notifications
wait 2
shot page
note Find the Style Choice; the clicks below use a guess of 1325,580.
rec caret 4 ptr move 1325 580 sleep 300 glide 1325 580 100 click sleep 1200 click
wait 1
note C1 (Material) caret turns over in about 200 ms on open and back on close, as QML (compare recording frames; batch 1 PASS 1.62-1.83 s and 3.95-4.17 s).
wait 1
ptr move 1325 580 sleep 300 glide 1325 580 100 click
wait 1
shot open
note C2 the list is open after the click.
ptr move 1325 580 sleep 300 glide 1325 580 100 click
wait 1
shot closed
note C2 clicking the Choice again closes the list (toggle).
key -k Escape
key -k Down
wait 1
shot down
note C3 pressing Down on the focused Choice opens the list.
key -k Escape
ipc panels close
